# Repository names (Gary)

When Gary refers to these repos, use these names exactly:

| Spoken name | Path | Role |
|-------------|------|------|
| **App Development** | `C:\PartnerAppPortal\src` | Active development / current working app |
| **new production** | `C:\PartnerAppPortal\Production\v.1` | Migration baseline for the new Azure subscription |

- “App Development” = the previous repo we built features in (Portal, API, CRM sync, scoring).
- “new production” = the full dump created for subscription migration (local git; Key Vault / SPN work targets this).
- Do not mix changes across repos unless Gary explicitly asks to sync or promote.
